top  screwing around and start actually  trying to run a balanced budget not  increasing the debt limit by trillions  of dollars and not spending our taxpayer  money as if it was  not theirs because ultimately what we  have is a spending problem in this  country and we have undisciplined  monetary and fiscal policy  and then they yell and they scream at  the very people who are simply trying to  provide jobs and trying to feed their  local communities

